    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD US TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><strong><i>Adding us to your wishlist helps us enormously!</i></strong><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A College of Thirst &amp; Claws</strong> is an immersive, story-driven adult visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a werewolf joining a supernatural college, you'll be thrown into the deep end of a sinister conspiracy in the town of Lanstone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with beautiful women as you shape your own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/c2d9aa8f900f2dd96775095662e96cb7.poster.avif?t=1753368769\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/c2d9aa8f900f2dd96775095662e96cb7.webm?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/c2d9aa8f900f2dd96775095662e96cb7.mp4?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You and your twin sister, spent your lives in a werewolf pack, where your father's the Alpha. Unfortunately, he harbours a deep hatred towards you and isolates you from the outside world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he abruptly forces you to leave and attend a unique college that helps supernatural beings mingle with humans, it seems the perfect opportunity to start a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plan was simple: mind your own business and never return to your pack. It would've been easy had you not aided a newly turned vampire. You've now found yourself in a sinister plot far beyond anything you anticipated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/e5a0f960cbb136e8ba2433c67a8de214.poster.avif?t=1753368769\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/e5a0f960cbb136e8ba2433c67a8de214.webm?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/e5a0f960cbb136e8ba2433c67a8de214.mp4?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Develop in-depth relationships with a cast of girls, including werewolves, vampires, mermaids and witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the seven main love interests, will your connections be romantic or purely sexual?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/cbdbe65aeac6626551de6a029499ea53.poster.avif?t=1753368769\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/cbdbe65aeac6626551de6a029499ea53.webm?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/cbdbe65aeac6626551de6a029499ea53.mp4?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Will you be hot-blooded and dominant or calm and analytical? Can you find the right balance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you stay under the radar, or will your choices draw unwanted attention?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/2a04ccbab1cf9e1527251b4e8c8555cb.poster.avif?t=1753368769\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/2a04ccbab1cf9e1527251b4e8c8555cb.webm?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/2a04ccbab1cf9e1527251b4e8c8555cb.mp4?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character-driven story shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10,000 stunning images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed cinematics to enhance your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of voice-acted sex scenes that will vary depending on your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving glossary to help you keep track of the characters and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and sound effects, designed for the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sex scene replay gallery and image favouriting to revisit memorable moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of achievements and other unlockables.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/dff69fcdc27171849e752aeacef20200.poster.avif?t=1753368769\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/dff69fcdc27171849e752aeacef20200.webm?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944560/extras/dff69fcdc27171849e752aeacef20200.mp4?t=1753368769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
